  "description_html": "<section aria-labelledby=\"courseDescription\">\n    Prerequisite: Admission to the Tech Honors Program or permission of the Honors Program Director.\n\nA continuation of ENGL 1013 with readings in poetry, fiction, and drama. \n\nNote: A grade of C or better must be earned in each of the two composition courses used to satisfy the general education requirement of English. May not be taken for credit after successful completion of ENGL 1023.\n    \n</section>",
